","textMapHash":1566523442,"text":"おいおい、もうあまり走り回るなよ！じゃないとまたこの前みたいに…","nextNodeIds":[710360207]},{"nodeId":710360207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志璇","textMapHash":2682074578,"text":"もうしませんって。先輩のおかげで、層岩巨淵もすごく安全になりました。地質的特徴も…まあ、だいぶ安定してます。","nextNodeIds":[710360208]},{"nodeId":710360208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志璇","textMapHash":2582301338,"text":"でも瑾武姉さんとヘディーヴは、まだあの不思議な結晶の…えっと…","nextNodeIds":[710360209]},{"nodeId":710360209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志璇","textMapHash":1089918482,"text":"波長？を研究するみたいですよ。ヘディーヴがそう言ってました。おおかたスメールのおかしな専門用語でしょう…とにかく、情報を集めるにはまず、ビーコンを配置しないと。","nextNodeIds":[710360210]},{"nodeId":710360210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志璇","textMapHash":3215082418,"text":"瑾武姉さんも、最近やっとビーコンを全部組み立てる時間ができたんです。それで、情報を集めるために、私がそれらのビーコンを特定の場所に配置しに行くことになりました。","nextNodeIds":[710360211]},{"nodeId":710360211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志璇","textMapHash":3918944274,"text":"一定期間で回収すれば、あとの計算は全部ヘディーヴがやってくれます。","nextNodeIds":[710360212]},{"nodeId":710360212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志璇","textMapHash":2963265458,"text":"以前はどの区域も危険だったので、限られた拠点内でしか測定できませんでした…","nextNodeIds":[710360213]},{"nodeId":710360213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志璇","textMapHash":4220405682,"text":"ですが、先輩によって道が開かれた今、ビーコンによる実地計測でより正確な情報が手に入るようになりました。","nextNodeIds":[710360214]},{"nodeId":710360214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志璇","textMapHash":1688903554,"text":"ふぅ…やっぱり、やることがあるって言うのはいいですね。そうだ、先輩も他に用事がないのなら、一緒に来てくださいよ！","nextNodeIds":[710360215,710360217]},{"nodeId":710360215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1135894602,"text":"じゃあ、行こうか。","nextNodeIds":[710360216]},{"nodeId":710360216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志璇","textMapHash":584092090,"text":"はい、行きましょう！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":710360217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4209833490,"text":"#{M#俺}{F#私}たちに何かメリットはある？","nextNodeIds":[710360218]},{"nodeId":710360218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1721112218,"text":"おい、なにがなんでも直接的すぎるだろ！まあ、オイラも気になるけど…","nextNodeIds":[710360219]},{"nodeId":710360219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志璇","textMapHash":741356370,"text":"あははっ、今回のはあくまでも簡単な行き来ですからね。強いて言うなら、瑾武姉さんからお礼を言われるくらいでしょうか。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":710360204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":9358538,"text":"#あまりよくないかな。{M#君}{F#あなた}は？","nextNodeIds":[710360205]},{"nodeId":710360205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志璇","textMapHash":1614690434,"text":"まあ…あんまり良いとは言えないですね。リスクのあることは全部先輩に任せちゃってますし、あははっ。","nextNodeIds":[710360206]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7103602,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["6","166001528,2"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_UI","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["20523"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":6,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7103604,"order":4,"stepDescription":"測定用のビーコンを置く","stepDescTextMapHash":270636764,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"wq7103604"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAY